.TH HOPASH-RULE-REMOVE 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.0" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-rule\-remove \- Remove one exact, complete Rule String
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash rule remove\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIRULE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove one exact, complete Rule String
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIRULE\fR>
Exact, complete Rule String to remove
